<title>POLAND: ZASADA MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZASADA MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.22 vs   0.59</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.59 vs   1.26</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.52 vs   1.99</p>
<p> Sales		   54.51 vs  29.19</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.56 vs   1.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.09 vs   3.75</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.68 vs   4.68</p>
<p> Sales		  120.69 vs  86.15</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish automotive grup is Sobieslaw</p>
<p>Zasada Centrum SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
